## about this project

this is a simple calculator program
it can add subtract multiply and divide two numbers
it runs in terminal
i made this using basic python only

## how to run

open terminal and type
```
python calculator.py
```

## what it can do

- add two numbers
- subtract two numbers
- multiply two numbers
- divide two numbers
- asks if you want to calculate again

## things i used in this code

- python
- while loop
- if conditions
- input and print functions
- int() to convert string to number

## how it works

first it asks you to enter two numbers
then it asks what operation you want to do
then it shows the answer
then it asks if you want to calculate again
if you type yes it starts again
if you type no it exits

## one thing to note

i used int() so only whole numbers work
like 5 and 3 will work
but 5.5 may not work properly

i learned while making this that you cannot divide by zero
so i added a check for that also

